OL,3,GNEWSATwo dead and one injured in
OL,4,Ahead-on crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have died following a
OL,7,Fhead-on crash near the Lincolnshire
OL,8,Fmarket town of Crowland.
OL,10,FEmergency crews were called at about
OL,11,F18:45 BST on Friday to reports of a
OL,12,Fcollision on the B1166 involving a red
OL,13,FHyundai and a grey Fiat.
OL,15,FThe male driver of the Hyundai and his
OL,16,Ffemale passenger were pronounced dead
OL,17,Fat the scene, while the driver of the
OL,18,Fother vehicle was taken to hospital
OL,19,Fwith injuries not thought to be
OL,20,Fserious, Lincolnshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
